I am a bit mystified by that statement.  My .config for 2.0.33 contains
the following constants:

 CONFIG_ALPHA_AVANTI
 CONFIG_ALPHA_XL
 CONFIG_ALPHA_XLT
 CONFIG_ALPHA_CABRIOLET
 CONFIG_ALPHA_EB66
 CONFIG_ALPHA_EB66P
 CONFIG_ALPHA_EB64P
 CONFIG_ALPHA_EB164
 CONFIG_ALPHA_PC164
 CONFIG_ALPHA_LX164
 CONFIG_ALPHA_SX164
