I solved my FPE problems by:

1. Using new glibc in Red Hat alpha errata section.
2. Using kernel 2.0.33.
3. Using Richard Henderson's patch to 2.0.33 (see
below). 

RH's message and patch follows below. I'm
not sure it is really necessary for the FPE problem,
but I had incorporated anyway.

Note again that I did not try to do the glibc fix--I
just used the new RPM from Red Hat and it apparently
had the fix (although I haven't yet been able to get
anyone to stand up and admit it!).
Good luck!

