Dear Wilf and original poster and any other Alpha YP users,

The problem is that glibc 2.0.7 breaks ypbind-3.3  My colleague Jon
Peatfield has found fix, albeit a temporary one. There is
also further advice from Thorsten Kukuk.

Our patch follows, and below that is Thorsten's response to our request
for help.

Have fun

Ian

>From J.S.Peatfield@damtp.cam.ac.uk Fri Apr 17 16:45:59 1998
Date: Tue, 14 Apr 1998 17:13:54 +0100
From: Jon Peatfield <J.S.Peatfield@damtp.cam.ac.uk>
