posted mail about this subject some time ago, compairing many compilers
on different platforms. I believe that the best choice is DEC fortran +
DEC UNIX. Unfortunately, we don't get the best
 of our Alphas with Linux. I supose that DEC Libraries are much more
optimized. Don't misunderstand, I'm a RH-Linux user, but I'm really
doubting if FOR THIS KIND OF CALCULATIONS, I won't have to move to
Digital. One big problem: money.
