I have been requested to supply more info. Here is more:

The systems are UDBs (one a 233MHz and the other a 166MHz).

mkswap is part of util-linux-2.7-15, which was an errata package to RHL 5.0 
(both systems are running it).

mkswap uses /lib/libc.so.6.1, which is part of glibc-2.0.7-6 (another errata 
package). 


