I would suggest ptrace but it doesn't seem to have come with my Alpha.
You can always attach to the X server with gdb immediately before it
crashes, and I think there's an X option to generate core on error.  Try:
"startx -- -core"

Of course, it helps if your X is compiled with debugging symbols.

