Try booting on your milo disk (dva0) and then from the MILO> prompt type
boot sde1:/vmlinux.gz root=/dev/sde1

being the sde1 is where your root partition is, and where vmlinux.gz is.

If you're not sure, try ls sde1 from the MILO> prompt to see what's on that
partition.

