Xmgr uses the Motiff libraries (the files you don't find). This libraries
are commercial, but you can use the free Motiff clone: Lesstiff. You can
find it following the links in the Red Hat site, or with a web search. I
successfully installed xmgr with a couple of very simple patches. Don't
pay atention to the warnings "cast to pointer of different size". It will
work fine for your purposes.

