The kernel does not know where to find the root partition.
You need to tell it, either manually, from the milo prompt, or by
ARC/AlphaBIOS parameters, such as the following line: boot sda2:vmlinux.gz
root=/dev/sda2
                                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Change the actual drive to suit your installation.

 

