Large file support exists in NFSv3.  Although 2.1.97 has nfs3xdr.c
files in both fs/nfs/ and fs/nfsd/ and a nfs3proc.c in fs/nfsd/, none
are included in the respective Makefiles.

In short, NFSv3 support was started but is not yet finished.  I don't
think anyone is actively working on it right now, but with any luck I
am mistaken on that point.

