I have PostgreSQL running fine on my 164SX.  There are already 64-bit 
patches in the source, but the configure script does not properly 
recognize Linux/AXP and compiles pgsql as if it were on Linux/Intel.

IIRC the pgsql source expects the symbol "linuxalpha".  The key is to
get -Dlinuxalpha into the makefiles.  If you get stuck I'll look for a 
patch I can send you.

