If you read the Alpha Miniloader Howto and carefully follow the steps, everything
is goingto be ok.

MILO can execute a command :
boot device_where_the_kernel_is:name_of_the_kernel root=root_device

example:

boot sda2:vmlinux.gz root=/dev/sda2

if the kernel is on a floppy:

boot fd0:vmlinux.gz root=/dev/sda2

you hace to type this command in the OSLOADOPTIONS option.
etc.

