system quite happily and successfully.

Next step, I went and got the package milo-sources-2.0.30-0.4.tgz and
unpacked them.  Went through make config in the milo directory.  Answered
yes to all questions (serial logging-Y,Digital Code-Y,Rebuild Palcode-Y).
