> Apr 29 21:23:37 octavia kernel: scsi0 : setting target 0 to asynchronous SCSI
> Apr 29 21:23:37 octavia kernel:   Vendor: CONNER    Model: CFP1080S          Rev: 4649
> Apr 29 21:23:37 octavia kernel:   Type:   Direct-Access                      ANSI SCSI revision: 02
